#: includes/Admin/Cod_Settings_Page.php:191
msgid "Tassyir checks every order before it exists (honeypot, phone and device limits, your spam rules). Behind Cloudflare, every visitor reaches your server from a Cloudflare address: tick this so Tassyir uses the visitor's real address instead (it checks that the request really came through Cloudflare)."
